{"data":{"id":"WWr7hor3i-w","slug":"araabmuzik","title":"araabMUZIK","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"eNjIOW6sBZI","slug":"darkside","title":"Darkside"},{"id":"5thoZgBUSrE","slug":"ynre","title":"Y.N.R.E"},{"id":"RzG5lbVeHxg","slug":"let-it-go","title":"Let It Go"},{"id":"SsbeEOnEPUk","slug":"face-off","title":"Face Off"},{"id":"t4d8x1Hnav8","slug":"faded","title":"Faded"}]},"markers":[{"id":"GqcLcLKW3xY","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"araabMUZIK - Darkside","track":{"id":"eNjIOW6sBZI","path":"/artists/araabmuzik/tracks/darkside/","slug":"darkside","title":"Darkside","artist":{"slug":"araabmuzik","title":"araabMUZIK"},"artwork":"images/artists/araabmuzik/tracks/darkside.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"MM9s0NIBs5g","position":34,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Araabmuzik - Y.N.R.E","track":{"id":"5thoZgBUSrE","path":"/artists/araabmuzik/tracks/y-n-r-e/","slug":"ynre","title":"Y.N.R.E","artist":{"slug":"araabmuzik","title":"araabMUZIK"},"artwork":"images/artists/araabmuzik/tracks/y-n-r-e.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Bd4yLv8Leyg","slug":"171","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-171"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #171","artwork":"/images/episodes/171.jpg","content":"Joe Kay returned with an immense amount and plenty of new ideas/inspiration after Coachella Weekend 1. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are so many new gems in here. We also recently discovered this new platform/label out of Sydney called: [@flowfi](https://soundcloud.com/flowfi) (Accidentally spelled them out wrong on the show as F-L-O), but these guys are coming with HEAT. Make sure you pay attention to them. If you feel this whole session please share. Lets keep educating people with real music. Catch you next week at the same time.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10801,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"GOTQDos0KcI","position":40,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Araabmuzik - Let It Go","track":{"id":"RzG5lbVeHxg","path":"/artists/araabmuzik/tracks/let-it-go/","slug":"let-it-go","title":"Let It Go","artist":{"slug":"araabmuzik","title":"araabMUZIK"},"artwork":"images/artists/araabmuzik/tracks/let-it-go.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"EVMFTD6oGnE","slug":"180","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/radio-show-180-w-hannah-faith"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #180 w/ Hannah Faith","artwork":"/images/episodes/180.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10759,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"w7TLNSZDst8","position":77,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Araabmuzik - Face Off","track":{"id":"SsbeEOnEPUk","path":"/artis